--[[
    Obsidian UI Library -- "bananahook" fork
    -----------------------------------------------
    A drop-in fork of Obsidian by deivid (github.com/deividcomsono/Obsidian),
    API modeled after LinoriaLib, visually identical to upstream Obsidian:
      - obsidian's exact scheme: (13) window, (15) sidebar/menus, (17)
        content, (23) footer bar, (25) inputs, (40) outlines, white text
      - Enum.Font.Code everywhere, dimmed purely through transparency
      - 48px title bar (icon + 20px title, current-tab info + search box),
        30% sidebar with 40px tab rows, 20px footer bar
      - real lucide icons (embedded sprite sheet, no Drawing API)
      - obsidian toggle switch / checkbox / dropdown / slider / inputs /
        colorpicker / keybind chips, draggable "Toggle"/"Lock" buttons,
        keybinds menu and slide-in notifications
      - two-tone brand: "banana" in white + "hook" in banana yellow

    Upstream scripts keep working: same CreateWindow / AddTab / AddGroupbox /
    AddToggle / AddSlider / AddDropdown / AddKeyPicker / Toggles / Options API.

    MIT licensed, same as upstream.
]]

